      "created_at": "2017-10-03T21:39:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, there is lot of speculation theorizing that Voss is the 10th scion, with people mentioning his first name being Rainek as a possible clue.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Not remembering that name I went and looked it up. That is his first name, but that isn't what caught my eye. This is: \"...work his way into commanding an elite strike force: <em><strong>the Nyxian Scourges</strong></em>.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now, I'm not saying there has to be a connection here, but we do know Nixious was the head of an Alien Cult, and we have no idea where that cult was located or how far spread it became. Did the Thorathians fight against the Cult of OBlivaeon in the far past, is Dok'Thorath the home planet of Nyxious who was exiled long ago. It just seems... possible... that there is something going on with that little tidbit.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:50:14.819Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
